---
// ExceptionHandling.astro (Jasa Workflow Automation)
---

<section class="exception-section" id="exception-handling">
  <div class="exception-container">
    
    <div class="section-header animate-fade-scroll" style="animation-delay: 100ms;">
      <h2 class="header-title">Tidak Semua Proses Harus Berjalan Otomatis</h2>
      <p class="header-intro">
        Otomasi yang baik bukan bertujuan untuk menyingkirkan manusia dari seluruh proses, melainkan menempatkan mereka hanya pada titik krusial yang memang memerlukan penilaian (judgment) manusia.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="exception-content animate-fade-scroll" style="animation-delay: 250ms;">
      
      <div class="ex-left">
        <h3 class="ex-title">Menangani Anomali (Exceptions)</h3>
        <p class="ex-desc">
          Workflow dirancang untuk dapat menangani skenario di mana sistem tidak bisa atau tidak seharusnya mengambil keputusan secara otomatis.
        </p>
        <ul class="ex-list">
          <li><span class="ex-bullet">✓</span> Data tidak lengkap (Missing information)</li>
          <li><span class="ex-bullet">✓</span> Kegagalan sistem eksternal (Failed process)</li>
          <li><span class="ex-bullet">✓</span> Kondisi di luar parameter standar (Escalation)</li>
          <li><span class="ex-bullet">✓</span> Kebutuhan persetujuan khusus (Manual review)</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <div class="ex-right">
        <!-- Visual Flow for Exception -->
        <div class="ex-flowchart">
          
          <div class="flow-step step-auto">
            System Automation
          </div>
          
          <div class="flow-arrow">↓</div>
          
          <div class="flow-step step-detect">
            <svg class="step-icon" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M10.29 3.86L1.82 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 0 0 1.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 0 0-3.42 0z"></path><line x1="12" y1="9" x2="12" y2="13"></line><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12.01" y2="17"></line></svg>
            <div class="step-text">
              <span class="st-label">Exception Detected</span>
              <span class="st-value">Payment verification gagal</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="flow-arrow arrow-red">↓</div>
          
          <div class="flow-step step-human">
            <svg class="step-icon" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"></circle></svg>
            <div class="step-text">
              <span class="st-label">Human Review</span>
              <span class="st-value">Finance Review (Approve/Reject)</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="flow-arrow arrow-green">↓</div>
          
          <div class="flow-step step-auto">
            Continue Workflow
          </div>
          
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .exception-section {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: var(--bg-primary);
    padding: 100px 24px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  }

  .exception-container {
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .section-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 60px;
  }

  .header-title {
    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 38px;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    margin: 0 auto 16px auto;
    max-width: 800px;
  }

  .header-intro {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #7D96C5;
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .exception-content {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 60px;
    background: rgba(7, 16, 32, 0.4);
    border: 1px solid #1B2A42;
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 50px;
  }

  .ex-left {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .ex-title {
    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    margin: 0 0 16px 0;
  }

  .ex-desc {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #A0B2D2;
    margin: 0 0 24px 0;
  }

  .ex-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .ex-list li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #D7E0F0;
  }

  .ex-bullet {
    color: #ef4444; /* red to indicate warning/exception */
    font-weight: bold;
  }

  .ex-right {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ex-flowchart {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 320px;
    background: rgba(4, 9, 20, 0.5);
    padding: 30px 20px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    border: 1px dashed #2b3e5b;
  }

  .flow-step {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .step-auto {
    background: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.1);
    color: #86efac;
    border: 1px solid rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.3);
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .step-detect {
    background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.15);
    color: #fca5a5;
    border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.4);
  }

  .step-human {
    background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15);
    color: #c4b5fd;
    border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.4);
  }

  .step-icon {
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .step-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
  }

  .st-label {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 10px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .st-value {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .flow-arrow {
    height: 24px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: #4b5a7a;
    font-weight: bold;
  }

  .arrow-red { color: #ef4444; }
  .arrow-green { color: #22c55e; }

  /* Animations */
  .animate-fade-scroll {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(15px);
    animation: fadeInUp 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) forwards;
  }

  @keyframes fadeInUp {
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }

  /* Light Theme */
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .exception-section {
    background-color: #FFFFFF;
  }

  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .header-title,
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .ex-title {
    color: #0F172A;
  }

  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .header-intro,
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .ex-desc {
    color: #475569;
  }

  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .exception-content {
    background: #F8FAFC;
    border-color: #E2E8F0;
  }

  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .ex-list li {
    color: #1E293B;
  }

  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .ex-flowchart {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border-color: #CBD5E1;
  }

  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .step-auto {
    background: #DCFCE7;
    color: #15803d;
    border-color: #86EFAC;
  }

  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .step-detect {
    background: #FEE2E2;
    color: #b91c1c;
    border-color: #FCA5A5;
  }

  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .step-human {
    background: #F3E8FF;
    color: #6d28d9;
    border-color: #D8B4FE;
  }

  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .flow-arrow {
    color: #94A3B8;
  }
  
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .arrow-red { color: #b91c1c; }
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .arrow-green { color: #15803d; }

  /* Responsive Design */
  @media (max-width: 850px) {
    .exception-content {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 40px;
      padding: 30px 20px;
    }

    .ex-left, .ex-right {
      width: 100%;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .exception-section {
      padding: 70px 16px;
    }

    .header-title {
      font-size: 32px;
    }
  }
</style>
